WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.792
A reshape is easier to reverse when each source value maps directly to one output value and we keep the category labels.

00:00:08.792 --> 00:00:16.522
It becomes lossy when multiple source rows are aggregated into one cell, when categories are combined,

00:00:16.522 --> 00:00:19.192
or when missing rows are removed.

00:00:19.192 --> 00:00:26.816
Always ask what information survives the transformation and what information cannot be recovered afterward.
